# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KSHakha Commerce AI — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in local values. NEVER commit a real `.env*` file.
# Every variable below is validated in `src/lib/env.ts` (Zod).
# Variables commented out are not required yet; they become required in the
# phase noted next to them. Do not add values you do not have yet.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Application (Phase 01) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
LOG_LEVEL=info

# ── Database (required from Phase 02) ────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string used by the application (least-privileged role).
# DATABASE_URL=
# Optional: separate privileged URL for `npm run db:migrate` only.
# MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL=

# ── Authentication & encryption (required from Phase 02) ─────────────────────
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32 (32 characters minimum)
# AUTH_SECRET=
# 32-byte key encoded as 64 hex characters. Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
# Used to encrypt Salla OAuth tokens at rest (AES-256-GCM).
# ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# ── Salla app credentials (required from Phase 03) ───────────────────────────
# Issued by https://salla.partners — server-side only.
# SALLA_CLIENT_ID=
# SALLA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# Must match the redirect URI registered in the Salla Partners app exactly.
# SALLA_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/integrations/salla/callback
# Per-webhook signing secret (Salla webhook security strategy: Signature).
# SALLA_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ── AI provider (required from Phase 14) ─────────────────────────────────────
# The AI layer is provider-agnostic. No provider is wired in Phase 01.
# AI_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_API_KEY=
# AI_DEFAULT_MODEL=
